    "['ppp mp mp-group [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces se-1/0/0 encapsulation ppp', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"The equivalent Juniper configuration command for `ppp mp mp-group 1/0/1` would be:\\n\\n##\\nset interfaces se-1/0/0 encapsulation ppp\\nset interfaces se-1/0/0 multilink-bundle ml-1/0/1\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n- Juniper uses `encapsulation ppp` to enable PPP on the serial interface (similar to Huawei's `link-protocol ppp`).\\n- The multilink PPP (MP) group is configured using `multilink-bundle` followed by the bundle name (here, `ml-1/0/1` as Juniper typically uses `ml-` prefix for multilink interfaces).\\n- The command binds the serial interface to the multilink bundle, analogous to Huawei's `ppp mp mp-group`.\", 'trans_template': 'set interfaces se-1/0/0 encapsulation ppp'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces se-1/0/0 multilink-bundle ml-1/0/1', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"The equivalent Juniper configuration command for `ppp mp mp-group 1/0/1` would be:\\n\\n##\\nset interfaces se-1/0/0 encapsulation ppp\\nset interfaces se-1/0/0 multilink-bundle ml-1/0/1\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n- Juniper uses `encapsulation ppp` to enable PPP on the serial interface (similar to Huawei's `link-protocol ppp`).\\n- The multilink PPP (MP) group is configured using `multilink-bundle` followed by the bundle name (here, `ml-1/0/1` as Juniper typically uses `ml-` prefix for multilink interfaces).\\n- The command binds the serial interface to the multilink bundle, analogous to Huawei's `ppp mp mp-group`.\", 'trans_template': 'set interfaces se-1/0/0 multilink-bundle ml-1/0/1'}]]": 1,
